      50.64,
      446.23,
      286.43,
      528.8
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land for the construction of intake and Pump House of Kahawatta Water Supply Scheme:",
