      50.64,
      540.58,
      286.42,
      629.36
    ],
    "text": "An allotments of land described below bearing Lot No. 254 depicted preliminary plan FVP 87 prepared on 23.02.2015 by the Ratnapura District Superintendent of Surveys in total Extent of 0.0343 Hectare situated in 232A Kotakethana Grama Niladhari Division in the village of Kotakethana in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division Godakawela in Ratnapura District.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItal",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.119687795639038,
      9.118988037109375,
      10.078991889953613
