      50.64,
      631.08,
      286.5,
      675.43
    ],
    "text": "Name of the land: Thippolewatta, Wijehinnagewatta, Dombagaha Watta; Discription: Garden, constructed pump & Intake well; Claimants: Mrs. Dharsani ramyalatha, (care",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
