    "text": "of Buwanaka) Pallegama Weedgoda, Mrs. L. Nansi Silva, Tempel Road Warapitiya, Kahawatta, Mrs. L. Wimalawathi, 13/A, Worapitiya Kahawatta, Mr. Daddumage Ajith Priyantha, Temple Road Kahawatta, Mrs. W. M. Podimanike, Temple Road Warapitiya, Kahawatta, Mrs. L. Kanthi Silwa, 50/G, Main Street, Kahawatta, Mr. P. M. Chandrasena, Kattange, Kahawatta, Mr. Wimaldharma and Mr. L. Vilsan Silwa, Jayasiri Home, Temple Road, Warapitiya, Kahawatta.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      434.72,
      539.41,
      559.76
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat Godakawela on the 18th day of January, 2016 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 11th day of January, 2016 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
